VulnApp - deliberately vulnerable web app for LOCAL security testing only.
Never expose it to the internet or a shared network.

  docker build -t vulnapp .
  docker run --rm -p 127.0.0.1:8080:80 vulnapp

Then open http://localhost:8080

Vulnerabilities:
  /login      SQL injection (auth bypass):   username: admin' --
  /search     SQL injection (UNION):         ' UNION SELECT id,username||':'||password,0 FROM users --
  /hello      Reflected XSS:                 ?name=<script>alert(1)</script>
  /guestbook  Stored XSS
  /ping       Command injection:             ?host=127.0.0.1;id
  /view       Path traversal:                ?file=../../../../etc/passwd
Also: hardcoded secret key, verbose SQL errors, runs as root, no CSRF protection.
